error[E5010]: a composition whose content captures 's' weakly cannot be stored here
  --> main.prism:6:19
    6 |     val app = App(composition { println(s.value) })
      |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ stored in a field here
  --> main.prism:6:41
    6 |     val app = App(composition { println(s.value) })
      |                                         ^ 's' is captured weakly here
   = note: the composition's content captures 's' weakly, so the composition keeps it borrowed while it is used
